\import{fdip-macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}
\tag{fdip}
\title{Pairings and discrete differences}
\date{2026-10-20}

\p{A difference map acquires an adjoint only after its pairings are
specified. Starting from the [real counting pairings](fdip-0002),
positive edge weights give a second edge pairing. Finite reindexing
relates forward and backward differences and identifies the
[positive kinetic factorization](fdip-0014).}

\transclude{fdip-0007}
\transclude{fdip-0014}
